WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.701
Count up on the right-hand group of four.

2
00:00:03.427 --> 00:00:06.527
The right-hand four cards make one hex digit.

3
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:27.430
Ten is A. Hex needs one digit for every value four bits can make.

4
00:00:37.278 --> 00:00:41.828
After F, the next group starts counting. Hex one zero is sixteen.
